  "description": "After losing her mother in a hit-and-run accident, the protagonist is left with a stepfather who sees her only as an object of lust. With nowhere to go and no one to turn to, she makes a desperate decision—to sell herself.\n\n\"The Woman Who Sells\" is a raw and intense adult manhwa that explores themes of survival, trauma, and the harsh realities a young woman faces when pushed to the brink. Set in the dark underbelly of society, it follows her journey as she navigates a world where her body becomes both her only weapon and her heaviest burden.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/courtesan?p_id=pn_015)",
